# Bahnhof board blacklist - one glob per line.
# Consumed at BUILD time only: the matcher filters the discovered
# destination list before anything is generated, so these rules and
# even their existence never reach the browser (nothing to find in F12).
#
# Patterns are matched against:
#   - the bare page slug            e.g.  drafts
#   - its host+path forms           e.g.  isui.ren/drafts , isui.ren/drafts/*
# Raw domain-wildcard patterns are also legal and simply never match a
# bare-slug candidate (kept for future subdomain-shaped destinations):
#   *.global.isui.ren
#
# Examples (uncomment to activate):
# isui.ren/test/*
# drafts
# *.global.isui.ren
